post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'

Magnetar COSMIC defaults installed to /etc/skel.

New accounts get them automatically. This account does not — /etc/skel applies
at account creation only. To take them:

  magnetar-apply-defaults --dry-run    # see what would change
  magnetar-apply-defaults              # apply, never overwriting what you set

What changes:
  Super+space         launcher -> jump
  Super+Shift+M/C/S   envelope / circle / slate
  Super+Shift+V       locket
  Super+e             home folder
  Terminal action     -> ghostty
  Theme               dark, no automatic switching

Log out and back in for shortcuts to take effect.

MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  cat <<'MSG'

magnetar-settings: defaults in /etc/skel were updated. Existing accounts are not
touched. Review and apply with:

  magnetar-apply-defaults --dry-run

MSG
}
